TOSS Terminal is a modified version of a terminal by Crynta, released under
the Apache License 2.0. Modifications (2026): tuios-style tiling for terminal
tabs, adapted from the ideas of tuios (https://github.com/Gaurav-Gosain/tuios):
BSP placement, a windowed look with gaps and title bars, and a Ctrl+B keyboard
layer; Spaces and an agents list; a translucent theme; a message line;
keybinding presets; command corrections; a minimal, terminal-style interface;
local dictation with Cactus Compute's Whistle model (Apache-2.0) on their
Needle engine; and removal of the built-in AI assistant. Files changed from
the original carry a "Modified for TOSS Terminal" note. Original copyright
notices are kept.
